ger Mills County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/oklahoma/roger-mills-county"],["ARC or PLC in Roger Mills County","/arc-plc/oklahoma/roger-mills-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids shows November to December under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 177% of normal in March to April and 37% in November to December. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 18421 had its driest year in 1956 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
